- ## profanity, ultimatum
+ ## profanity, ultimatum

- - `Interaction.apply(events: Iterator[Terminal.Event]^, state)`, `Interactivity.apply(iterator:
-   Iterator[event]^): Interactivity[event]^{iterator}`, `Interactivity#eventIterator():
-   Iterator[event]^{this}` and `Form#run(events: Iterator[Terminal.Event]^)` use
-   `murmuration.Iterator`; a hand-rolled event source is now `new Iterator[Terminal.Event]:` with
-   `advance()`/`current`. An `Interactivity` implementation declares `eventIterator()` as
-   returning `Iterator[event]^{this}`: the events it hands out are captured by the
-   `Interactivity`, and may be the same iterator on every call. (#2235)
+ - `Interaction.apply(events: Iterator[Terminal.Event]^, state)`、`Interactivity.apply(iterator: Iterator[event]^): Interactivity[event]^{iterator}`、`Interactivity#eventIterator(): Iterator[event]^{this}`、`Form#run(events: Iterator[Terminal.Event]^)` は `murmuration.Iterator` を使う。手書きのイベント源は、`advance()`/`current` を持つ `new Iterator[Terminal.Event]:` になった。`Interactivity` の実装は `eventIterator()` を `Iterator[event]^{this}` を返すものとして宣言する。それが渡すイベントは `Interactivity` に捕捉され、呼び出しのたびに同じイテレーターであってもよい。(#2235)

